cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

title: "labapi"
abstract: >-
  labapi is a Python library that translates the flat LabArchives API into a
  Python object model following the existing hierarchy of the web interface,
  allowing workflows to navigate and modify notebook content through familiar
  paths.

